From b5ce9f9769aa9631faba48558e5a0c28e82a6907 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 10:37:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] test(app): raise the hang barrier of the
 evaluation-capped pins to 120 s

The two pins whose work is bounded by an evaluation cap used a 30 s
wall-clock barrier. Measured in debug: a lowered-cap refusal takes
0.06 s, the default-cap pin 52 s serial. The barrier is now 120 s; the
cap stays the bound.

Refs #1605

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
